      "Runs test and coverage validation steps before release work proceeds.",
      "Verifies secret scanning and dependency vulnerability checks are complete.",
      "Guides version updates across package, configuration, and capability files.",
      "Reviews changelog, README, feature matrix, and template synchronization status.",
      "Outlines package build, Git tag, push, and PyPI publication handoff steps."
